    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "0EB8263E4E4027DD",
      "text": "Do you want to face the Exceptional Everyman\\nhimself, Gym Leader Larry?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "0EB8233E4E4022C4",
      "text": "In that case, please head onto the battle court.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "0EB8243E4E402477",
      "text": "Please feel free to come back whenever you\\nare ready.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "0EB8223E4E402111",
      "text": "Laaarrryyy! You’re up!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_01",
      "hash64": "E4ECB2AC02E1AAE5",
      "text": "Hello.[VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_02",
      "hash64": "E4ECAFAC02E1A5CC",
      "text": "I’m Larry. I’m assigned to work as the Gym\\nLeader of the Medali Gym.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_03",
      "hash64": "E4ECB0AC02E1A77F",
      "text": "Good job on making your way through the\\nGym Test.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_04",
      "hash64": "E4ECADAC02E1A266",
      "text": "And, well...maybe try the other dishes on the\\nmenu too sometime. Everything’s good here.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_05",
      "hash64": "E4ECAEAC02E1A419",
      "text": "Anyway, my boss will dock my pay if I spend too\\nmuch time chitchatting.\\c\\nLet’s get this battle over with.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_06",
      "hash64": "E4ECABAC02E19F00",
      "text": "Thank you for doing business with us today.\\nI, Larry, will be at your service.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_07",
      "hash64": "E4ECACAC02E1A0B3",
      "text": "You’re rather strong, aren’t you? Enough to bring\\nout my poker face, even.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_08",
      "hash64": "E4ECB9AC02E1B6CA",
      "text": "I lost, so that means I have to give you a\\nbadge, but...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_09",
      "hash64": "E4ECBAAC02E1B87D",
      "text": "That battle made me a bit hungry. Care to join\\nme for a meal?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_badge",
      "hash64": "3B461CE2FFA60749",
      "text": "Having [VAR 0x0200(0001)] Gym Badge[VAR 0x1101(0001,0100)]s in hand makes it easier to\\ncatch Pokémon of up to Lv. [VAR 0x0201(0002)].\\c\\nOh, and they’ll actually listen to you, too...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0200",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0002"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_badge_all",
      "hash64": "36909BBFC4BE01F9",
      "text": "If you have 8 Gym Badges, you’ll be able to\\ncatch Pokémon of any level. They’ll never\\r\\nquestion who’s the boss, either.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_10",
      "hash64": "E4F037AC02E4C2BB",
      "text": "The dishes here... They’ve all got flavor.\\nGood flavor, I mean.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_waza",
      "hash64": "8A8AE8E413551DA3",
      "text": "This is for you. Though hopefully a child like you\\nhas no need to put on its namesake...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_11",
      "hash64": "E4F036AC02E4C108",
      "text": "Oh, don’t worry about the bill. I do earn a salary,\\nafter all.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_normal_12",
      "hash64": "E4F039AC02E4C621",
      "text": "Now, I’d better get back to work. If you’ll\\nexcuse me.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "gym_normal_040_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "0EB8213E4E401F5E",
      "text": "Congratulations! You’re now certified by the\\nMedali Gym!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
